    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This arcade game features a spaceship called 'the Falcon'. The mission is simple: land the Falcon vertically! Try to use your fuel as efficiently as possible to land safely. Throughout the five sectors, each containing twelve levels, you'll encounter obstacles such as asteroids and curious UFOs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is based on the game Astrolander (Timesplitters 2). It has a minimalistic style that evokes the feeling of the arcade era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game using your keyboard or an X-box controller.\u00a0</p>",
